# dev-keystore.jks is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# It is committed so every build is signed identically and installs over the
# last one instead of forcing an uninstall that would delete the user's stored
# sessions. It is public, worthless as a secret, and must never sign a Play
# Store release. A real release key would be a CI secret and would never be in
# a repository at all.
